OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOften cloudy with frequent
OL,6,Fshowers, these heavy at times with a
OL,7,Frisk of thunder and hail. Strong
OL,8,Fwinds, particularly along coasts and
OL,9,Fassociated with heavier showers. Mild
OL,10,Ffor the time of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining unsettled this
OL,13,Fevening with a band of more persistent
OL,14,Frain arriving into the southwest and
OL,15,Fpushing across the region into the
OL,16,Fnight. Showers following on behind.
OL,17,FWindy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
