OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA generally cloudy day with
OL,6,Fshowery outbreaks throughout and a
OL,7,Frisk of thunder at times associated
OL,8,Fwith heavier showers. Remaining windy
OL,9,Falong the south coast and cooler.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fon Friday, clearing into the afternoon
OL,13,Fand becoming colder with localised
OL,14,Ffrosts overnight. A fine start to the
OL,15,Fweekend but turning much windier with
OL,16,Frain likely on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
